  "summary": "👋 Hi, I'm Nisarg, a seasoned Software Engineer with over five years of experience in system design, application development, testing, and operational stability. I work across a wide range of technologies including Python, Java, Golang, and JavaScript, with a strong focus on front-end engineering using ReactJS, Redux, and NodeJS. I enjoy solving complex problems and building reliable, user-friendly systems.\n\n🎓 I completed my Master of Science in Software Engineering from Drexel University, where I also worked as a Course Assistant supporting 120+ students in software design principles and agile practices. At TATA Consultancy Services, I expanded my expertise by designing customer-facing experiences, developing reactive microservices in Java, and implementing secure REST APIs.\n\n🛠️ In my current work, I focus on identifying patterns, eliminating recurring issues, and improving the overall stability and performance of software applications. I collaborate closely with internal teams and external partners to review architectures, validate technical designs, and ensure the delivery of high-quality, maintainable solutions. I value a work culture rooted in diversity, respect, and continuous learning.\n\n🤖 I’m also deeply interested in AI and its real-world applications. I actively explore LLM-powered development, AI-driven automation, vector search, embeddings, and intelligent system design. I enjoy experimenting with machine learning workflows, prompt engineering, and integrating AI capabilities into web applications to improve efficiency, enhance user experience, and unlock new product possibilities.\n\n💡 My technical toolkit includes HTML5, CSS3, TypeScript, ReactJS, NodeJS, Vue.js, REST APIs, Docker, Kubernetes, AWS, Azure, and a variety of databases like MySQL, MongoDB, SQLite, MS SQL Server, Cassandra, and Oracle. I also work regularly with agile methodologies, CI/CD pipelines, application resiliency strategies, and security best practices.\n\n🌟 I’m passionate about building innovative, scalable solutions that drive business outcomes and elevate user experience. I'm always open to new ideas, learning opportunities, and meaningful collaborations. If you're exploring how software engineering and AI can create impact, let’s connect.",
